# Optional. Everything has a safe default; the lab needs no tenant and no credentials, and reads nothing from the shared settings file.
# The shared settings file is ~/Development/.env (mode 600; STANDALONE_ENV overrides the path) for the apps that need a tenant. This lab does not.
# Per-run settings (shell, not a file; the shared file holds no PORT):
# PORT=4950                       # must be in 4950-4999
# STLAB_BIND=127.0.0.1            # loopback only unless you set this on purpose (the container does)
# HOST_PORT=4950                  # Docker only: the host port compose publishes on 127.0.0.1
